OL,3,GNEWSACouple spend #400 making
OL,4,AGhostbusters car for Halloween
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith Halloween quickly approaching,
OL,7,Fpeople across the north-west of England
OL,8,Fhave certainly been getting into the
OL,9,Fspooky spirit.
OL,11,FFor some, it means much more than just
OL,12,Fputting out a pumpkin and buying a
OL,13,Ftonne of sweets to hand out to the
OL,14,Flocal kids out trick or treating.
OL,16,FTake the Towler family from St Helens,
OL,17,Ffor example.
OL,19,FThey have been busy 3D printing,
OL,20,Fwelding and even buying a #400 car
OL,21,Fahead of fright night.
